function registerModes(id,p,hydrate=value=>value){p=hydrate(p);profiles[id]=p;for(const key of ['areaModes','traditionModes','targetModes','pulseChoices','fieldCompanions'])for(const mode of Array.isArray(p[key])?p[key]:Object.entries(p[key]??{}).map(([id,m])=>({id,...m}))){const child={...p,...mode,id:id+'-'+mode.id};delete child[key];registerModes(child.id,child,hydrate);}}
